#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:49
msgid "Marcher sur les braises, ça forme."
msgstr "Walking on embers builds character."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:54
msgid "Ça grince, mais ça part plus vite."
msgstr "It creaks, but it fires faster."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:59
msgid "Prélevé sur quelque chose de gros."
msgstr "Taken from something big."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:64
msgid "Trouve toujours le point faible."
msgstr "Always finds the weak spot."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:72
msgid "Les âmes viennent à vous, et plus nombreuses."
msgstr "Souls come to you, and in greater numbers."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:77
msgid "Le fil ne pardonne rien."
msgstr "The edge forgives nothing."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:84
msgid "Serrées, sales, mais elles tiennent."
msgstr "Tight, filthy, but they hold."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:89
msgid "Il a déjà servi. Souvent."
msgstr "It has been used before. Often."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:96
msgid "Corrosif. Très corrosif."
msgstr "Corrosive. Very corrosive."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:101
msgid "Cadence en hausse, puissance en baisse."
msgstr "Fire rate up, power down."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:106
msgid "Lourdes, mais on encaisse."
msgstr "Heavy, but you can take it."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:112
msgid "Voit plus loin, vise mieux."
msgstr "Sees further, aims better."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:117
msgid "Chaque blessure infligée vous nourrit. Le soin par seconde est plafonné."
msgstr "Every wound you deal feeds you. Healing per second is capped."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:123
msgid "Plus rapide, plus vif."
msgstr "Faster, sharper."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:131
msgid "Chaque grain a été quelqu'un."
msgstr "Every bead was once someone."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:137
msgid "Épais comme une promesse. Le soin par seconde est plafonné."
msgstr "Thick as a promise. Healing per second is capped."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:145
msgid "+30 % de dégâts aux boss et aux élites, −10 % aux autres."
msgstr "+30% damage to bosses and elites, −10% to everything else."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:154
msgid "+1 projectile. Les projectiles supplémentaires frappent plus faiblement."
msgstr "+1 projectile. Extra projectiles hit weaker."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:160
msgid "Des coups lourds, plus espacés."
msgstr "Heavy blows, further apart."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:165
msgid "La puissance contre la chair."
msgstr "Power in exchange for flesh."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:171
msgid "Frapper juste plutôt que frapper souvent."
msgstr "Strike true rather than strike often."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:177
msgid "Le fer qui a percé le flanc. Les traits ne s'arrêtent plus au premier corps : ils cherchent le suivant."
msgstr "The iron that pierced the side. Your bolts no longer stop at the first body: they seek the next one."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:183
msgid "Tenir la ligne, quitte à tirer moins."
msgstr "Hold the line, even if it means firing less."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:191
msgid "Votre pouvoir revient 30 % plus vite. Caïn garde 30 % de sa Marque en la dépensant."
msgstr "Your power recharges 30% faster. Cain keeps 30% of his Mark when he spends it."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:200
msgid "Les coups critiques traversent un ennemi de plus."
msgstr "Critical hits pierce one more enemy."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:207
msgid "Le poids de la faute rend léger."
msgstr "The weight of guilt makes you light."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:216
msgid "Les ennemis tués explosent (70 % des dégâts de l'arme). Les explosions ne s'enchaînent pas."
msgstr "Slain enemies explode (70% of weapon damage). Explosions do not chain."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:222
msgid "Le temps s'accélère, vous vous usez."
msgstr "Time speeds up, and you wear out."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:228
msgid "+2 % de dégâts toutes les 25 éliminations, plafonné à +40 %."
msgstr "+2% damage every 25 kills, capped at +40%."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:236
msgid "Les élites sont 50 % plus fréquentes et rendent deux fois plus d'âmes."
msgstr "Elites are 50% more common and give twice as many souls."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:243
msgid "+1 projectile, mais une vue plus courte."
msgstr "+1 projectile, but shorter sight."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:251
msgid "Renvoie 30 % des dégâts de contact subis."
msgstr "Reflects 30% of the contact damage you take."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:257
msgid "Régénère 1.2 PV par seconde."
msgstr "Regenerates 1.2 HP per second."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:263
msgid "Beaucoup plus d'âmes récoltées, au prix de la puissance."
msgstr "Far more souls harvested, at the cost of power."

#: scripts/items/item_database.gd:269
msgid "La première relance de chaque boutique est offerte."
msgstr "The first reroll in each shop is free."

